/--
A concrete four-field package directly yields the two truth-vector invariants.
This is the forward use of the active skeleton, without first repackaging it
as a `Nonempty` equivalence.
-/
theorem StabilizedSaturationBasisNoDirectSplitQuotientFactorization.invariants
    {In₁ : Type u}
    {In₂ : Type v}
    {Out₁ : Type w}
