/--
Prove the by-round finite-state separation target from transition-relevant
history determinacy.

This is the constructive mathematical route: if the stabilized by-round truth
atom determines the no-direct transition-relevant trace, and the chosen
automaton history state respects that trace, then the finite semantic pair is
determined by the truth atom.
-/
theorem byRoundFiniteStateSeparation_of_relevantHistoryEq
    {In₁ : Type u}
    {In₂ : Type v}
    {Out₁ : Type w}
    {Out₂ : Type a}
    {AState : Type (max u v w a b)}
    {Alphabet : Type (max u v w a)}
