receipt/order route.

The finite progress component is the stabilized truth atom.  The caller still
has to prove automaton-state invariance, parity invariance, append-level
receipt/order determinacy, and the explicit mixed empty-prefix compatibility
case.
-/
noncomputable def noDirectCoherentParityProgressCertificateOf_currentOrderAppendDeterminesReceiptOrderAndEmptyCompatibility
    {In₁ : Type u}
